WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.984
- [Woman] Question really is,

00:00:00.984 --> 00:00:03.554
like, what's the ROI 
on not giving a fuck

00:00:03.554 --> 00:00:05.413
and being 
unapologetically yourself?

00:00:05.413 --> 00:00:06.984
'Cause that's kinda where--
- Speed.

00:00:06.984 --> 00:00:09.036
Speed. When you're not

00:00:09.036 --> 00:00:11.614
spending any time worrying,

00:00:11.614 --> 00:00:14.144
you're spending 
time on executing.

00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:18.373
Speed is the game in 
what we all do for a living.

00:00:18.373 --> 00:00:23.024
And if you're not 
worried about dwelling

00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:26.685
on what people think,
you're in execution mode.

00:00:26.685 --> 00:00:28.656
And I do everything 
in my possession,

00:00:28.656 --> 00:00:30.156
everything in my power, 
excuse me,

00:00:30.156 --> 00:00:33.685
to put myself in full
execution mode at all times.

